<metadata><name>Snowlands 0306 Mount Judah and Donner Peak</name><desc>out and back to waypoint 7 + spur to 4 + spur to 6. 3.7 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/03/0306_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
